  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Seed Workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Last year, SeedNL in collaboration with Wageningen University &amp; Research (WUR), Naktuinbouw, the Ministry of Agriculture, Nature and Food Quality (LNV) and Innovision, carried out an assessment regarding the seed sector in Bangladesh. The assessment report discusses and zooms in on the seed systems of potatoes, vegetables and flowers. For each of these crops, it elaborates on key bottlenecks as well as ambitions towards the development of a well-functioning seed sector in Bangladesh. The purpose of this project is to organize a workshop around the findings of the seed scoping report and develop a shared roadmap on how to strengthen the Bangladeshi seed sector together with both public and private actors in Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
